# Wear the Ring of Elemental Command (Water) (WATER_BREATHING) and cast True
# Seeing (TRUE_SIGHT), then open the character sheet and dump its Specials and
# Perception sections (bd inc-frhx). Read the result with
# tools/check_sheet_water_true_sight.sh.
#
#   INCURSION_OPTIONS=tools/fixtures/options-2026-08-22.dat \
#       tools/headless.sh tools/keys/sheet-water-breathing-true-sight.keys <seed>
#
# The ring comes from wizard mode's Item Acquisition, as in
# tools/keys/water-breathing-deep-water.keys. True Seeing comes from wizard
# mode's Learn Any Spell and a self-cast, as in tools/keys/true-sight-observe.keys.
#   ring-on     the ring is on a finger.
#   truesight   the screen after the cast (the spell's message).
#   specials    the sheet scrolled until its Perception heading shows, with the Special Abilities list above it.
#   perception  eight lines further, so the Perception and Vision rows are on screen.

@include chargen-mage.keys

@while "mass grave" ESC

w
y
@choose "Wizard Mode Switches"
DOWN*7
SPACE
ESC

w
@choose "Item Acquisition"
RIGHT*26
@until "Ring of Item Preservation" DOWN
ENTER
m
SPACE
@dump:ring-on
ESC

w
@choose "Learn Any Spell"
"True Seeing"
ENTER

m
@choose "True Seeing"
@while "more --" SPACE
@dump:truesight

d
@expect "Gender"
C
@dump:cond
ESC
@until "Perception and Vision" PGDN
@dump:specials
PGDN*8
@dump:perception
ESC

@quit
